<h1 data-copy-en="Brandy" data-copy-zh="Brandy">Brandy</h1>
<p class="starter-description" data-copy-en="Recruitment conversations, tavern activities and worker upgrades." data-copy-zh="招募谈心、酒馆行动与员工升级。">Recruitment conversations, tavern activities and worker upgrades.</p>
<div class="wiki-source-line"><span data-copy-en="v1.0_BETAx · Updated 9 November 2026" data-copy-zh="v1.0_BETAx · 2026 年 11 月 9 日更新">v1.0_BETAx · Updated 9 November 2026</span></div></div></section>
<section class="section wiki-reading-section"><div class="container wiki-reading-layout">
<aside class="wiki-toc"><div class="wiki-toc-inner"><button aria-expanded="false" class="wiki-toc-toggle" data-wiki-toc-toggle="" type="button"><span data-copy-en="On this page" data-copy-zh="本页目录">On this page</span><span aria-hidden="true">+</span></button><p class="wiki-toc-heading" data-copy-en="On this page" data-copy-zh="本页目录">On this page</p><div class="wiki-toc-links" data-lang-panel="en" data-wiki-toc-links=""><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-overview">Overview</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-location">Where to find them</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-route">Route and relationship milestones</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-activities">Activities and rewards</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-troubleshooting">What usually blocks the next step</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-related">Related guides</a></div><div class="wiki-toc-links" data-lang-panel="zh" data-wiki-toc-links="" hidden="" lang="zh-CN"><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-overview">概览</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-location">在哪里找到</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-route">路线与关系节点</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-activities">行动与奖励</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-troubleshooting">常见卡点</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-related">相关指南</a></div></div></aside>
<article class="wiki-article"><div class="wiki-source-content wiki-source-content-en" data-lang-panel="en" lang="en"><section id="en-overview"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="If_Progress_Stalls"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Clothing"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="One-Time_Resort_Scenes"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Sunset_Walk_with_Brandy"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Sunset_Walk_Best_Answers"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Resort_Activities"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Community_Scenes"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Tavern_Evening_Date"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Brandy_Joins_the_Team"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="About_the_Rose_.26_Thorn"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="About_the_Rose_&amp;_Thorn"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Life_Philosophy"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Home_H2H_Best_Answers"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Meeting_and_Recruiting_Brandy"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Quick_Stats"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Overview"></span><h2>Overview</h2><figure class="reviewed-screenshot" style="max-width: 256px"><a aria-label="View full screenshot: Brandy — character portrait." href="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/brandy.webp" rel="noopener" target="_blank"><img alt="Brandy — character portrait." decoding="async" height="175" loading="lazy" src="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/brandy.webp" width="175"/></a><figcaption>Brandy — character portrait.</figcaption></figure><p>Brandy’s useful early goal is her three-conversation recruitment chain. Joining needs Friend (100), Rose &amp; Thorn ownership and reputation 8; it does not need Crush or a separate hiring payment.</p></section>
<section id="en-location"><h2>Where to find them</h2><p>Rowdy Alehouse: 22:00–24:00 and 00:00–03:00. After recruitment she also appears at The Bar from 17:00–22:00. Tip, Order Beer, Give Flowers and the recruitment H2Hs start at the Alehouse; Talk, Drink, Flirt and the date are also available at the Bar.</p></section>
<section id="en-route"><h2>Route and relationship milestones</h2><p>Life Philosophy → About the Rose &amp; Thorn → Brandy Joins. Complete them in order. The last conversation immediately activates her as a worker. Tavern Evening is a separate once-only date and is not a recruitment prerequisite.</p><details><summary>Optional reference: personal and shared event navigation</summary><p>Each listed event happens once. Return to the named place after completing its prior steps. Completion affection is a base reward; dialogue choices can add further affection. The scenes and choice answers remain in the game.</p><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Event</th><th scope="col">Requirements</th><th scope="col">Base completion affection</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Bar Duet</th><td data-label="Requirements">The Bar; 21:00–22:00; Sandra Friend (100); Brandy Friend (100); Sandra, Brandy recruited; Brandy, Sandra not on vacation</td><td data-label="Base completion affection">Sandra +5; Brandy +5</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Lessons in Charm</th><td data-label="Requirements">The Bar; 20:00–24:00; Pepper Acquaintance (50); Brandy Known (25); Pepper recruited; Brandy, Pepper not on vacation</td><td data-label="Base completion affection">Pepper +5; Brandy +5</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">On The House</th><td data-label="Requirements">The Bar; An Unexpected Visit; Brandy recruited; Brandy not on vacation</td><td data-label="Base completion affection">Esperanza +4; Brandy +3</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">The Spice Incident</th><td data-label="Requirements">Kitchen; 12:00–18:00; Poppy Known (25); Pepper Known (25); Brandy Known (25); A Cheerful Cook Arrives; Brandy, Pepper recruited; Brandy, Pepper not on vacation</td><td data-label="Base completion affection">Poppy +5; Pepper +5; Brandy +5</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">The Unbeatable Challenge</th><td data-label="Requirements">The Bar; 21:00–24:00; Sherry Friend (100); Brandy Friend (100); Brandy not on vacation</td><td data-label="Base completion affection">Sherry +5; Brandy +5</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Understanding the Night</th><td data-label="Requirements">Rowdy Alehouse; 22:00–24:00 or 00:00–03:00; Elara Friend (100); own Rose &amp; Thorn; Brandy, Elara not on vacation</td><td data-label="Base completion affection">Elara +5; Brandy +5</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Professional Admiration</th><td data-label="Requirements">The Bar; 17:00–22:00; Elara Friend (100); Brandy Friend (100); Brandy recruited; Brandy, Elara not on vacation</td><td data-label="Base completion affection">Elara +5; Brandy +5</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">When Warriors Meet Chaos</th><td data-label="Requirements">Rowdy Alehouse; 20:00–24:00; Valkyra Acknowledged (10); Brandy Acknowledged (10); Brandy, Valkyra not on vacation</td><td data-label="Base completion affection">Valkyra +5; Brandy +5</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">The Perfect Performance</th><td data-label="Requirements">Performance Stage; 14:00–18:00; Esperanza Acknowledged (10); Brandy Acknowledged (10); Brandy not on vacation</td><td data-label="Base completion affection">—</td></tr></tbody></table></details></section>
<section id="en-activities"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Musical_Performance_Reaction"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Crafted-Gift_Training_Upgrades"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Worker_Visits_and_Eight_Training_Levels"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Daily_Relationship_Actions"></span><h2>Activities and rewards</h2><details><summary>Action costs, requirements and rewards</summary><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Action</th><th scope="col">Requirements / usable start time</th><th scope="col">Base cost / recovery</th><th scope="col">Reward / normal limit</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Tip Brandy</th><td data-label="Requirements / usable start time">Rowdy Alehouse; Stranger (0)</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">10 min; $10</td><td data-label="Reward / normal limit">+1 base affection; 10/day</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Talk to Brandy</th><td data-label="Requirements / usable start time">Rowdy Alehouse / The Bar; Stranger (0)</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">20 min</td><td data-label="Reward / normal limit">+1 base affection; 8/day</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Order Beer</th><td data-label="Requirements / usable start time">Rowdy Alehouse; Stranger (0)</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">20 min; $20; −10 Energy</td><td data-label="Reward / normal limit">+1 base affection; 5/day</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Drink with Brandy</th><td data-label="Requirements / usable start time">Rowdy Alehouse / The Bar; Known (25)</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">25 min; $40; −15 Energy</td><td data-label="Reward / normal limit">+3 base affection; 3/day</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Give Flowers</th><td data-label="Requirements / usable start time">Rowdy Alehouse; Known (25)</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">15 min; 1 Flowers</td><td data-label="Reward / normal limit">+5 base affection; 1/day</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Flirt with Brandy</th><td data-label="Requirements / usable start time">Rowdy Alehouse / The Bar; Friend (100)</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">20 min; −10 Calm</td><td data-label="Reward / normal limit">+2 base affection; 3/day</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Tavern Evening</th><td data-label="Requirements / usable start time">Rowdy Alehouse / The Bar; Friend (100); Alehouse 22:00–24:00, or Bar 17:00–21:00 after recruitment</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">120 min; $50; −45 Energy</td><td data-label="Reward / normal limit">once; +8 base affection on event completion</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Life Philosophy</th><td data-label="Requirements / usable start time">Rowdy Alehouse; Known (25)</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">60 min; −15 Energy; +10 Calm</td><td data-label="Reward / normal limit">once</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">About the Rose &amp; Thorn</th><td data-label="Requirements / usable start time">Rowdy Alehouse; Friend (100); own Rose &amp; Thorn; Life Philosophy</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">75 min; −18 Energy; +12 Calm</td><td data-label="Reward / normal limit">once</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Brandy Joins</th><td data-label="Requirements / usable start time">Rowdy Alehouse; Friend (100); About the Rose &amp; Thorn; Rose &amp; Thorn reputation 8; full version</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">90 min; −20 Energy; +15 Calm</td><td data-label="Reward / normal limit">recruits Brandy; once</td></tr></tbody></table></details><p>After recruitment, training upgrade events and resort activities are additional options. The shared event table gives the exact relationship and location gates; vacation activities are described separately below.</p><details><summary>Optional reference: permanent worker training upgrades</summary><p>These are extra portrait actions for permanent worker training improvements. Carry the specified crafted gift; it is consumed. Each upgrade doubles training experience for its own training and adds +50% worker income, stacking additively with the other upgrade.</p><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Action</th><th scope="col">Conditions / start time</th><th scope="col">Cost</th><th scope="col">Result</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">After the Last Toast</th><td data-label="Conditions / start time">Rowdy Alehouse; Brandy In Love (3000); Tavern Evening with Brandy; Brandy not on vacation; 22:00–24:00 / 00:00–03:00</td><td data-label="Cost">0 min; consumes 1 Hexbound Rose Sachet</td><td data-label="Result">Cowgirl upgrade; once</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Every Color Is Mine</th><td data-label="Conditions / start time">The Bar; Brandy In Love (3000); Brandy: Life Philosophy; Brandy not on vacation; 17:00–22:00</td><td data-label="Cost">0 min; consumes 1 Prismatic Spell Brooch</td><td data-label="Result">Oral upgrade; once</td></tr></tbody></table></details><details><summary>Optional reference: while on vacation</summary><p>Assign her to vacation through Worker Rooms first. Resort portraits are rolled on arrival and are not guaranteed at every stop. These contextual activities replace the usual home menu while she is encountered there; the sunset H2H has no extra affection threshold for Brandy or Cinnamon.</p><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Activity</th><th scope="col">Place / start time</th><th scope="col">Time / normal limit</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Talk</th><td data-label="Place / start time">07:00–23:00</td><td data-label="Time / normal limit">15 min; 6/day</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Eat together</th><td data-label="Place / start time">Sirena Isle Buffet 11:00–16:00</td><td data-label="Time / normal limit">60 min; 1/day</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Relax together</th><td data-label="Place / start time">Sirena Isle Beach 08:00–16:00</td><td data-label="Time / normal limit">60 min; 1/day</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Evening spa visit</th><td data-label="Place / start time">Sirena Isle Spa 19:00–23:00</td><td data-label="Time / normal limit">60 min; 1/day</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Sunset walk H2H</th><td data-label="Place / start time">Sirena Isle Beach 17:00–20:00</td><td data-label="Time / normal limit">60 min; 1/day, repeatable on later days</td></tr></tbody></table><p><a href="game-systems-sirena-isle-resort.html">See the Resort guide for resort construction, vacation slots and shared rewards.</a></p></details><details><summary>Optional reference: relationship bonuses</summary><p>Meeting each favorite-stat threshold adds 1 to ordinary base affection before the remaining relationship bonuses. The favorite skill doubles the adjusted base. Direct one-time affection rewards are added as listed.</p><p>Stamina 40; Charm 45; Creativity 50</p><p>Favorite skill: Crowd Control (current UI: Crowd Control)</p></details><p>Start windows exclude their ending hour. Listed time and resources are base values; applicable skills, difficulty and active bonuses can change the shown cost or affection. Base affection, direct affection, player Erotic Experience and NPC intimacy experience are separate.</p></section>
<section id="en-troubleshooting"><h2>What usually blocks the next step</h2><ul><li>If Brandy Joins is missing, check reputation 8 and the previous H2H, as well as Friend (100).</li><li>The Bar and Alehouse copies share normal daily limits for the same action.</li><li>Return her from vacation for home events that require her not to be away.</li></ul></section>
<section id="en-related"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Related_Pages"></span><h2>Related guides</h2><ul><li><a href="game-systems-brothel.html">Workers and training</a></li><li><a href="game-systems-sirena-isle-resort.html">Vacation activities</a></li><li><a href="character-elara.html">Elara</a></li><li><a href="character-sherry.html">Sherry</a></li></ul></section>
</div><div class="wiki-source-content wiki-source-content-zh" data-lang-panel="zh" hidden="" lang="zh-CN"><section id="zh-overview"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-If_Progress_Stalls"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Clothing"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-One-Time_Resort_Scenes"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Sunset_Walk_with_Brandy"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Sunset_Walk_Best_Answers"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Resort_Activities"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Community_Scenes"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Tavern_Evening_Date"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Brandy_Joins_the_Team"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-About_the_Rose_.26_Thorn"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-About_the_Rose_&amp;_Thorn"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Life_Philosophy"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Home_H2H_Best_Answers"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Meeting_and_Recruiting_Brandy"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Quick_Stats"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Overview"></span><h2>概览</h2><figure class="reviewed-screenshot" style="max-width: 256px"><a aria-label="查看完整截图：Brandy 的角色头像。" href="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/brandy.webp" rel="noopener" target="_blank"><img alt="Brandy 的角色头像。" decoding="async" height="175" loading="lazy" src="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/brandy.webp" width="175"/></a><figcaption>Brandy 的角色头像。</figcaption></figure><p>Brandy 的前期重点是三段谈心招募路线。加入要求朋友（100）、拥有玫瑰与荆棘且声誉达到 8，不要求迷恋阶段，也没有额外雇佣费。</p></section>
<section id="zh-location"><h2>在哪里找到</h2><p>喧闹酒馆：22:00–24:00 与 00:00–03:00；招募后也会在酒吧于 17:00–22:00 出现。打赏、点啤酒、送花与招募谈心在酒馆开始；交谈、共饮、调情与约会也可在酒吧使用。</p></section>
<section id="zh-route"><h2>路线与关系节点</h2><p>人生哲学 → 关于玫瑰与荆棘 → Brandy加入。请依次完成；最后一段谈心结束后即加入员工名单。「酒馆之夜」是独立的一次性约会，不是招募前置。</p><details><summary>可选查阅：个人与共同事件的触发条件</summary><p>下列事件均为一次性内容。完成前置后，请返回对应地点。完成好感度列为基础奖励，对话选择还可能追加好感度。剧情与选项答案请在游戏中体验。</p><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">事件</th><th scope="col">条件</th><th scope="col">完成基础好感度</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">酒吧二重唱</th><td data-label="条件">酒吧; 21:00–22:00; Sandra 朋友 (100); Brandy 朋友 (100); Sandra, Brandy 已招募; Brandy, Sandra 未在度假</td><td data-label="完成基础好感度">Sandra +5; Brandy +5</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">魅力课程</th><td data-label="条件">酒吧; 20:00–24:00; Pepper 相识 (50); Brandy 已知 (25); Pepper 已招募; Brandy, Pepper 未在度假</td><td data-label="完成基础好感度">Pepper +5; Brandy +5</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">本店请客</th><td data-label="条件">酒吧; 意料之外的造访; Brandy 已招募; Brandy 未在度假</td><td data-label="完成基础好感度">Esperanza +4; Brandy +3</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">香料事件</th><td data-label="条件">厨房; 12:00–18:00; Poppy 已知 (25); Pepper 已知 (25); Brandy 已知 (25); 开朗厨娘到来; Brandy, Pepper 已招募; Brandy, Pepper 未在度假</td><td data-label="完成基础好感度">Poppy +5; Pepper +5; Brandy +5</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">不可战胜的挑战</th><td data-label="条件">酒吧; 21:00–24:00; Sherry 朋友 (100); Brandy 朋友 (100); Brandy 未在度假</td><td data-label="完成基础好感度">Sherry +5; Brandy +5</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">读懂夜晚</th><td data-label="条件">喧闹酒馆; 22:00–24:00 或 00:00–03:00; Elara 朋友 (100); 拥有玫瑰与荆棘; Brandy, Elara 未在度假</td><td data-label="完成基础好感度">Elara +5; Brandy +5</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">职业仰慕</th><td data-label="条件">酒吧; 17:00–22:00; Elara 朋友 (100); Brandy 朋友 (100); Brandy 已招募; Brandy, Elara 未在度假</td><td data-label="完成基础好感度">Elara +5; Brandy +5</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">当战士遇上混乱</th><td data-label="条件">喧闹酒馆; 20:00–24:00; Valkyra 已遇见 (10); Brandy 已遇见 (10); Brandy, Valkyra 未在度假</td><td data-label="完成基础好感度">Valkyra +5; Brandy +5</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">完美演出</th><td data-label="条件">表演舞台; 14:00–18:00; Esperanza 已遇见 (10); Brandy 已遇见 (10); Brandy 未在度假</td><td data-label="完成基础好感度">—</td></tr></tbody></table></details></section>
<section id="zh-activities"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Musical_Performance_Reaction"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Crafted-Gift_Training_Upgrades"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Worker_Visits_and_Eight_Training_Levels"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Daily_Relationship_Actions"></span><h2>行动与奖励</h2><details><summary>行动消耗、条件与奖励</summary><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">行动</th><th scope="col">条件／可开始时间</th><th scope="col">基础消耗／恢复</th><th scope="col">奖励／常规次数</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">给 Brandy 小费</th><td data-label="条件／可开始时间">喧闹酒馆; 陌生人 (0)</td><td data-label="基础消耗／恢复">10 分钟; $10</td><td data-label="奖励／常规次数">+1 基础好感度; 10次/日</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">和 Brandy 交谈</th><td data-label="条件／可开始时间">喧闹酒馆／酒吧; 陌生人 (0)</td><td data-label="基础消耗／恢复">20 分钟</td><td data-label="奖励／常规次数">+1 基础好感度; 8次/日</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">点啤酒</th><td data-label="条件／可开始时间">喧闹酒馆; 陌生人 (0)</td><td data-label="基础消耗／恢复">20 分钟; $20; −10 精力</td><td data-label="奖励／常规次数">+1 基础好感度; 5次/日</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">与Brandy喝酒</th><td data-label="条件／可开始时间">喧闹酒馆／酒吧; 已知 (25)</td><td data-label="基础消耗／恢复">25 分钟; $40; −15 精力</td><td data-label="奖励／常规次数">+3 基础好感度; 3次/日</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">送花</th><td data-label="条件／可开始时间">喧闹酒馆; 已知 (25)</td><td data-label="基础消耗／恢复">15 分钟; 1 鲜花</td><td data-label="奖励／常规次数">+5 基础好感度; 1次/日</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">与Brandy调情</th><td data-label="条件／可开始时间">喧闹酒馆／酒吧; 朋友 (100)</td><td data-label="基础消耗／恢复">20 分钟; −10 镇定</td><td data-label="奖励／常规次数">+2 基础好感度; 3次/日</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">酒馆之夜</th><td data-label="条件／可开始时间">喧闹酒馆／酒吧; 朋友 (100); 酒馆 22:00–24:00；招募后也可在酒吧 17:00–21:00 开始</td><td data-label="基础消耗／恢复">120 分钟; $50; −45 精力</td><td data-label="奖励／常规次数">一次性; +8 事件完成基础好感度</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">人生哲学</th><td data-label="条件／可开始时间">喧闹酒馆; 已知 (25)</td><td data-label="基础消耗／恢复">60 分钟; −15 精力; +10 镇定</td><td data-label="奖励／常规次数">一次性</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">关于玫瑰与荆棘</th><td data-label="条件／可开始时间">喧闹酒馆; 朋友 (100); 拥有玫瑰与荆棘; 人生哲学</td><td data-label="基础消耗／恢复">75 分钟; −18 精力; +12 镇定</td><td data-label="奖励／常规次数">一次性</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Brandy加入</th><td data-label="条件／可开始时间">喧闹酒馆; 朋友 (100); 关于玫瑰与荆棘; 玫瑰与荆棘声誉 8; 完整版</td><td data-label="基础消耗／恢复">90 分钟; −20 精力; +15 镇定</td><td data-label="奖励／常规次数">招募 Brandy；一次性</td></tr></tbody></table></details><p>招募后还有训练升级事件与度假活动。共同事件表列出关系与地点条件；下方另列度假活动。</p><details><summary>可选查阅：永久员工训练升级</summary><p>这些额外肖像行动可永久强化员工训练。需携带指定制作礼物，并会消耗礼物。每次升级使对应训练获得的经验翻倍，且每项增加 50% 员工收入，两项收入加成相加。</p><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">行动</th><th scope="col">条件／开始时段</th><th scope="col">消耗</th><th scope="col">效果</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">最后一杯之后</th><td data-label="条件／开始时段">喧闹酒馆; Brandy 恋爱中 (3000); 与 Brandy 的酒馆之夜; Brandy 未在度假; 22:00–24:00 / 00:00–03:00</td><td data-label="消耗">0 分钟；消耗 1 咒缚玫瑰香囊</td><td data-label="效果">女上位训练升级；一次性</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">每一种颜色都是我</th><td data-label="条件／开始时段">酒吧; Brandy 恋爱中 (3000); Brandy: 人生哲学; Brandy 未在度假; 17:00–22:00</td><td data-label="消耗">0 分钟；消耗 1 棱彩法术胸针</td><td data-label="效果">口交训练升级；一次性</td></tr></tbody></table></details><details><summary>可选查阅：度假期间</summary><p>先通过员工房间安排她度假。抵达度假地点时才会判定遇见谁，并非每次都能见到她。遇见时会显示度假专用菜单；Brandy 与 Cinnamon 的日落谈心没有额外好感度门槛。</p><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">活动</th><th scope="col">地点／开始时段</th><th scope="col">耗时／常规次数</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">交谈</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">07:00–23:00</td><td data-label="耗时／常规次数">15 分钟；6次/日</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">一起用餐</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">塞壬岛自助餐 11:00–16:00</td><td data-label="耗时／常规次数">60 分钟；1次/日</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">一起放松</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">塞壬岛海滩 08:00–16:00</td><td data-label="耗时／常规次数">60 分钟；1次/日</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">夜间水疗</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">塞壬岛水疗馆 19:00–23:00</td><td data-label="耗时／常规次数">60 分钟；1次/日</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">日落散步谈心</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">塞壬岛海滩 17:00–20:00</td><td data-label="耗时／常规次数">60 分钟；1次/日，可在之后的日子重复</td></tr></tbody></table><p><a href="game-systems-sirena-isle-resort.html">度假村建设、度假名额与共同奖励见度假村指南。</a></p></details><details><summary>可选查阅：关系加成</summary><p>每达到一项偏好属性门槛，普通好感度计算的基础值增加 1；偏好技能会将调整后的基础值翻倍。标为直接好感度的一次性奖励按表中数值加入。</p><p>耐力 40; 魅力 45; 创造力 50</p><p>偏好技能：群体影响〔当前界面：人群控制〕</p></details><p>开始时段不包含结束整点。表中耗时与资源为基础值；适用技能、难度及当前加成可能改变界面显示的消耗或好感度。基础好感度、直接好感度、玩家情欲经验与 NPC 亲密经验分别计算。</p></section>
<section id="zh-troubleshooting"><h2>常见卡点</h2><ul><li>看不到加入谈心时，除朋友（100）外，也要检查声誉是否达到 8，以及上一段谈心是否完成。</li><li>同一行动在酒吧与酒馆共用常规每日次数。</li><li>要求她不在度假的原居所事件，需要先结束度假。</li></ul></section>
